GLM-5.3-Flash on three DGX Sparks: a continuation of NNNtrance's recipe

This repository is a fork of https://github.com/NNNtrance/GLM-5.3-Flash-EXL3-DGX-Spark
at commit 7f1bd29cf473548212b8b731c52dcf2c7aa5a033 (Apache-2.0). The upstream git
history, LICENSE, CREDITS.md and LICENSES.md are retained unchanged. Upstream's
README.md is kept verbatim as UPSTREAM-README.md.

Everything under three-sparks/ and the top-level README.md and NOTICE are
Copyright (c) 2026 Ben Katzir and are distributed under the same Apache License,
Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). The private launcher, the authentication middleware,
the acquisition and evidence tooling, the long-context client and memory guard,
and the video fixtures and tests were written for this deployment; the runtime
patch tree under three-sparks/runtime/ is upstream's tracks/tp3 patch set
flattened into the layout the prelude expects, with its inserted vision hook and
xgrammar call, and is upstream's work.

Third-party components this recipe builds or downloads (none are redistributed
here):

- Zeuss5/cuda-exl3 at 754421fc99919317b9a4cf2928797bae8f870040 (MIT), which
  carries ExLlamaV3 attribution (MIT, (c) 2025 Turboderp). See licenses/.
- autoscriptlabs/nccl-mesh-plugin at 19924dcc7c571d6e260953724d394ae50bad82cf
  (MIT) with upstream's patches 0004/0005/0006 applied at build time.
- vllm/vllm-openai base image at
  sha256:905c02933be6021301db2dc284e24e3727467aa3a0f63b41d609885778a07bce
  (vLLM is Apache-2.0; the NVIDIA CUDA, cuDNN and NCCL binaries inside the image
