- turboderp/GLM-5.3-Flash-exl3 at 2a30229e67012798ba9f0cd832bb78abf4c363d5 (MIT)
  and zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash (MIT) for the chat template.
- incoai/GLM-5.3-Flash-DFlash2 at dc77ff1c99eeb2df044ee3d4f0094eb033fee410
  (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0): non-commercial, no derivatives. This deployment was a
  personal, non-commercial evaluation. Do not serve commercially with this draft.

Model weights, the API key, node addresses, raw startup logs and the long-context
prompt archives are not part of this repository.
